{"unit_id":"zuihouye__dsh-agnes-tools#feature-image","repo":"zuihouye/dsh-agnes-tools","commit":"d8b00cc76d0b8c0ef378076c3c68b756a28ba22b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-agnes-tools 的功能「文字生成图片」：把提示词、画幅和尺寸档位提交给 Agnes 图像模型，保存图片到输出目录，并在宿主支持时附加到回复。通过 agnes_image 工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:260-342"]}
{"unit_id":"zuihouye__dsh-agnes-tools#feature-edit","repo":"zuihouye/dsh-agnes-tools","commit":"d8b00cc76d0b8c0ef378076c3c68b756a28ba22b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-agnes-tools 的功能「图片编辑与合成」：用户提供提示词和一张或多张本地图片、公开 URL 或 data URI，工具请求 Agnes 编辑并保存结果。通过 agnes_edit_image 触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:260-342"]}
{"unit_id":"zuihouye__dsh-agnes-tools#feature-video","repo":"zuihouye/dsh-agnes-tools","commit":"d8b00cc76d0b8c0ef378076c3c68b756a28ba22b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-agnes-tools 的功能「生成视频」：按提示词提交文字、首尾帧或参考图模式的视频任务，并轮询状态；完成后下载 mp4，超时则返回 video_id。通过 agnes_video 触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:346-453"]}
{"unit_id":"zuihouye__dsh-agnes-tools#feature-resume","repo":"zuihouye/dsh-agnes-tools","commit":"d8b00cc76d0b8c0ef378076c3c68b756a28ba22b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-agnes-tools 的功能「续查视频任务」：传入先前返回的 video_id 查询尚未完成的任务，完成后自动下载 mp4 并返回文件路径。通过 agnes_video_status 触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:409-473"]}
{"unit_id":"zuihouye__dsh-agnes-tools#feature-models","repo":"zuihouye/dsh-agnes-tools","commit":"d8b00cc76d0b8c0ef378076c3c68b756a28ba22b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-agnes-tools 的功能「查看可用模型」：使用当前配置的 Agnes 密钥请求模型列表，并返回模型名称和数量，便于核对访问权限。通过 agnes_models 触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:476-493"]}
{"unit_id":"zuihouye__dsh-agnes-tools#caveat-key","repo":"zuihouye/dsh-agnes-tools","commit":"d8b00cc76d0b8c0ef378076c3c68b756a28ba22b","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-agnes-tools 使用前须知：调用 Agnes API 需要密钥，可通过配置或 DSH 凭据提供，并作为 Bearer 凭据发送给 API。见 lib/index.js:117-155。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:117-155"]}
{"unit_id":"zuihouye__dsh-agnes-tools#caveat-save","repo":"zuihouye/dsh-agnes-tools","commit":"d8b00cc76d0b8c0ef378076c3c68b756a28ba22b","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-agnes-tools 使用前须知：生成的图像和视频会写入本机 outputDir，默认目录为 dsh 进程工作目录下的 agnes-output；运行环境需要有该目录的写权限。见 lib/index.js:168-179。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:168-179"]}
